# ── Google OAuth ──────────────────────────────────────
# Set up in: Supabase Dashboard → Authentication → Providers → Google
# Then configure the OAuth app in: Google Cloud Console → Credentials
# No extra env vars needed here — just add your Client ID & Secret in Supabase.
#
# Authorized redirect URI to add in Google Cloud Console:
#   https://your-project-id.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
#
# Authorized JavaScript origins to add in Google Cloud Console:
#   http://localhost:5173   (for local dev)
#   https://your-production-domain.com  (for prod)
